invariant: INV-14
file: tls.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: the webpki ch_connect hashes the configuration for a session that
  takes tickets but leaves ch_tls.takes_tickets at 0. So handshake_post.c
  gives no ticket to on_ticket, and no session can resume. The
  received-ticket rows object.

--- old
    t->takes_tickets = (uint8_t)webpki_takes_tickets(cfg);
    if (t->takes_tickets) {
--- new
    if (webpki_takes_tickets(cfg)) {
